## Day 2: React 进阶 / React Advanced

### 📚 每日内容 (Daily Content)

**核心概念 (Key Concepts):**
- Effect Hook (useEffect) - 副作用 / Side Effects
- 条件渲染 (Conditional Rendering)
- 列表渲染与 Keys / List Rendering & Keys
- React Router 基础 / React Router Basics

**代码示例 (Code Example):**
```jsx
// Todo App with useEffect
import React, { useState, useEffect } from 'react';

function TodoApp() {
  const [todos, setTodos] = useState([]);
  const [input, setInput] = useState('');

  // 模拟API调用 / Simulate API call
  useEffect(() => {
    console.log('组件挂载或todos变化 / Mount or todos changed');
  }, [todos]);

  const addTodo = () => {
    if (input.trim()) {
      setTodos([...todos, { id: Date.now(), text: input }]);
      setInput('');
    }
  };

  return (
    <div>
      <input 
        value={input} 
        onChange={(e) => setInput(e.target.value)}
        placeholder="输入任务 / Enter task"
      />
      <button onClick={addTodo}>添加 / Add</button>
      <ul>
        {todos.map((todo) => (
          <li key={todo.id}>{todo.text}</li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>
  );
}
```

